      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Per-device X.509 identity on AWS IoT Core\n**5 sensors + 1 rogue device**, emulated in Python, each with its **own certificate** (mutual TLS, port 8883).\n\n1. **Authenticate**: no valid certificate, no connection\n2. **Authorize**: a device may use only its own topics\n3. **Detect & respond**: misbehaviour → alert → automatic quarantine"
